1
00:00:02,837 --> 00:00:04,405
What brings you here?

2
00:00:07,590 --> 00:00:10,492
I'm actually starting work here today.

3
00:00:12,887 --> 00:00:15,292
You're. the new hire!

4
00:00:16,533 --> 00:00:18,456
No wonder you looked familiar.

5
00:00:19,996 --> 00:00:21,541
But, hey..are you okay?

6
00:00:21,933 --> 00:00:23,301
You were really drunk last night.

7
00:00:26,602 --> 00:00:28,240
Can we just forget last night?

8
00:00:28,671 --> 00:00:29,692
It was a mistake.

9
00:00:30,430 --> 00:00:31,430
A mistake?

10
00:00:33,287 --> 00:00:33,876
I mean...

11
00:00:33,910 --> 00:00:35,324
I had one-night..

12
00:00:35,324 --> 00:00:36,442
A one-night stand?

13
00:00:42,176 --> 00:00:44,261
So that's why you left?

14
00:00:44,702 --> 00:00:46,055
No, that's not what I meant.

15
00:00:48,940 --> 00:00:50,370
I odn't usually sleep

16
00:00:50,370 --> 00:00:52,536
with someone I just met.

17
00:00:55,026 --> 00:00:56,232
Well... I liked it.

18
00:01:00,427 --> 00:01:01,633
I liked it.

19
00:01:02,179 --> 00:01:04,364
Being with you, spending the night.

20
00:01:05,911 --> 00:01:07,587
I thought you felt the same.

21
00:01:07,855 --> 00:01:09,177
Guess not?

22
00:01:11,968 --> 00:01:12,968
That's really a shame.

23
00:01:13,697 --> 00:01:14,697
No, I mean...

24
00:01:18,627 --> 00:01:19,627
I did

25
00:01:22,181 --> 00:01:23,181
like it too.

26
00:01:25,654 --> 00:01:27,369
It's just

27
00:01:27,938 --> 00:01:30,069
this is all really new to me.

28
00:01:35,091 --> 00:01:36,598
Moring!

29
00:01:38,997 --> 00:01:40,997
You are the newbie?
